may not be copied, modified, distributed, published or used in other software
without written permission. The repository being public does not grant these
rights; use is permitted only to the extent required by GitHub's Terms of
Service (viewing the repository and forking it within GitHub).

Data is not covered by this license. Timetable, stop, route and map data used by
the app or produced by the data pipeline (veri/) remain under the license of
their source; see "Veri kaynakları" in README.md. In particular:
  - assets/veri/istanbul-poi.db and other data derived from OpenStreetMap:
    © OpenStreetMap contributors, Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
  - Istanbul Metropolitan Municipality open data: İBB Open Data License.
